  "description": "\u201cThe incenter of the medial triangle M_a M_b M_c and center of mass of the uniform perimeter wireframe of triangle ABC.\u201d\n\u2014 Clark Kimberling's Encyclopedia of Triangle Centers (ETC) \u2022 X_10 (Spieker Center)\n\nInteractive GEOMETOR Explorer page: https://geometor.github.io/etc/centers/c-00001-00019/x-00010/\n\n1 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: X_10 = Spieker Center \u2022 Incenter of Medial \u25b3M_a M_b M_c\n2 \u00b7 GOAL: X_10 = Spieker Center \u2022 Incenter of Medial \u25b3M_a M_b M_c\n3 \u00b7 ASSERT: Trilinears bc(b+c) : ca(c+a) : ab(a+b) \u2022 Barycentrics b+c : c+a : a+b\n4 \u00b7 INTERSECT: Nagel Line {1, 2, 8, 10} \u2022 Line {4, 9, 10, 19}\n5 \u00b7 INTERSECT: Nagel Line {1, 2, 8, 10} \u2022 Line {4, 9, 10, 19}\n6 \u00b7 PROVE: Complement of X_1 (Incenter) \u2022 Midpoint of X_1 & X_8 \u2022 Isogonal X_58\n7 \u00b7 \u2234: Kimberling (6, 9, 13) Search = 3.098898934005\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 ETC \u2022 X_10",
